      "body": "Full year 2026 results: EPS: ₹42.05 (down from ₹68.40 in FY 2025). Revenue: ₹172.4b (down 22% from FY 2025). Net income: ₹15.0b (down 39% from FY 2025). Profit margin: 8.7% (down from 11% in FY 2025). The decrease in margin was driven by lower revenue. Revenue is forecast to grow 15% p.a. on average during the next 2 years, compared to a 5.8% growth forecast for the Industrials industry in Asia. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 2% per year whereas the company’s share price has increased by 3% per year.",
