      "body": "Siemens Limited announced that, the Board of Directors of the Company, at its Meeting held on 26 May 2026. The company announced that Mr. Tim Holt, who retires by rotation at the ensuing 68th AGM, does not seek re-appointment as Director of the Company at the said AGM, due to his other commitments. Accordingly, Mr. Holt shall cease to be a Director of the Company post the ensuing 68th AGM. The vacancy caused post Mr. Holt's retirement is proposed not to be filled up. Mr. Matthias Rebellius, Special Director (Nominee of Siemens AG), is retiring from Siemens AG. Consequently, he has tendered his resignation as Special Director (Nominee of Siemens AG) of the Company, effective close of business hours of 30 September 2026. (resignation letter will be filed once it is effective).",
